## 1. Day 1 Objective

The objective of Day 1 was to understand the problem FieldOps aims to solve, identify its intended users, define the minimum viable product (MVP), and document the proposed business workflows before beginning software implementation.

The focus was on understanding **what the system should do and why**, rather than immediately writing code.

## 2. Project Overview

FieldOps is a proposed web-based field service management application for small businesses offering services such as:

- CCTV installation and repair.
- Computer networking.
- Electrical installation and maintenance.
- Other technical field services.

The application aims to help businesses register customer requests, assign technicians, track job progress, and maintain a history of important activities.

The underlying business problem remains a hypothesis requiring validation with potential users.

