## 10. Day 1 Reflection

Day 1 focused on planning before implementation.

The main achievement was establishing a structured foundation for FieldOps, including its intended users, proposed business processes, functional requirements, and initial technical direction.

An important lesson was that building software involves more than writing code. Requirements analysis, domain understanding, documentation, version control, and deliberate design decisions are also essential engineering activities.

The next step is to use these documents to guide domain modelling, while keeping unresolved business assumptions visible.

